    "title": "Women's basketball falls to St. Bonaventure 68-65 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hunter Malloy ,\n17 hours ago Binghamton women’s basketball closed out its three-game home-stand season opener on Tuesday, hosting the St. Bonaventure Bonnies in their first Division I matchup of the year. Despite holding the lead for the majority of the game, the Bearcats fell to Bonaventure 68-65, marking their first loss of the 2025-26 season. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
